usage: csk bootstrap [-h] [--skills-root SKILLS_ROOT]
                     [--preferred-locale PREFERRED_LOCALE]
                     [--default-agents DEFAULT_AGENTS] [--non-interactive]
                     [--force | --if-missing]

Asks for machine-level settings: skills_root, preferred_locale, and default_agents. Shell profile changes are not required. Flags override the prompts; --non-interactive disables prompting entirely.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --skills-root SKILLS_ROOT
                        directory containing skill git repositories
  --preferred-locale PREFERRED_LOCALE
                        preferred install locale, e.g. ru
  --default-agents DEFAULT_AGENTS
                        comma-separated agent ids, e.g. codex_cli,claude_code
                        (known: claude_code, codex_cli, cursor, gemini,
                        opencode, windsurf)
  --non-interactive     never prompt; fail instead
  --force               overwrite an existing config without asking
  --if-missing          create config only when absent; keep an existing
                        config unchanged

Files written:
  ~/.cocoaskills/config.json.

Examples:
  csk bootstrap
  csk bootstrap --non-interactive --skills-root ~/skills --default-agents codex_cli,claude_code
  csk bootstrap --if-missing --non-interactive --skills-root ~/skills
